---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Toddler Program" description="Our toddler program for children aged 1.5 to 2.5 years at Junior Hub.">
    <section id="banner">
      <h2>
        <b><span style="color: white; font-size: 125">Toddler</span></b>
      </h2>
      <p>
        18 Months to 2.5 Years <br />
        1 Staff : 5 Children
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Main -->
    <section id="main" class="container">
      <section class="box special">
        <p>
          Our industrious toddlers enjoy a fun and supportive environment that
          encourages exploration with a hands-on approach. Our educators
          celebrate toddlers growing sense of curiosity, independence, and
          expression. Our educators listen, observe and interact with each
          toddler to provide learning activities that will extend their
          learning. Our toddler program provides children opportunities for
          safe, supervised play, while encouraging their exploration and
          desire to test the boundaries of their abilities. Educators offer
          children a variety of creative, sensory, language, music and motor
          experiences. As social skills develop, educators support toddlers
          with their emerging capacity for interactive and cooperative play in
          a warm, positive environments.
        </p>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="row-6 row-12-mobilep">
            <h3>Full-time</h3>
            <p>7:30am - 6:00pm</p>
          </div>
          <div class="row-6 row-12-mobilep">
            <h3>Part-time</h3>
            <p>
              9:00am - 12:00pm <br />
              1:30pm - 4:30pm
            </p>
          </div>
          <span class="image featured"
            ><img src="/images/toddler.jpg" alt="image"
          /></span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
</Layout>
